<body>
<h1>Measuring a Shared Path</h1>
<p>The walking estimate is <math><semantics><mtext>d = vt</mtext><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d = vt</annotation></semantics></math>. Với từng đoạn đường, ta có thể tính tổng như sau:</p>
<p><math display="block"><semantics><mtext>
D = \sum_{i=1}^{n} d_i
</mtext><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">
D = \sum_{i=1}^{n} d_i
</annotation></semantics></math></p>
<p>A slower pace changes the total time, not the map scale.</p>
</body>
